 lang=\"ja\">きっぷ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">票；券；票券</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220860\">この<ruby>切符<rp>(</rp><rt>きっぷ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">罚单上收留了两个人</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きつい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">严峻；艰苦；苛刻；严格；坚定；意志坚强；强势；强悍；凶悍；强烈；剧烈；浓烈；（过）紧；紧绷；贴身；极端；异常强烈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199848\">トムは<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にきつい<ruby>一発<rp>(</rp><rt>いっぱつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汤姆的头部受了重重的一击。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2024197\" title=\"Tatoeba · fercheung\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fercheung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気付く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きづく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">注意到；意识到；察觉到；发觉；感觉到；疑心；恢复意识；苏醒；清醒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"164413\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>気付<rp>(</rp><rt>きづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれずに<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそれをやった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是他干的,我不认识他</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">規定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">规定；规则；条款；条例；当量浓度；规定动作（体操）；规定套路；规定舞蹈（花样滑冰）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220161\">この<ruby>犯罪<rp>(</rp><rt>はんざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>法律<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はある<ruby>罰則<rp>(</rp><rt>ばっそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>規定<rp>(</rp><rt>きてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">法律规定了对这一罪行的某些惩罚。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">起点</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">起点；出发点；原点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">軌道</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轨道；运行轨迹；铁路轨道；铁轨；正轨；正确轨道</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188969\"><ruby>衛星<rp>(</rp><rt>えいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>周<rp>(</rp><rt>まわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りの<ruby>軌道<rp>(</rp><rt>きどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">卫星在绕月轨道上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気に入る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きにいる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喜欢；满意；中意；合意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229189\">いくつかの<ruby>点<rp>(</rp><rt>てん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在某些方面不喜欢她</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">記入</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きにゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记入；填写；填入</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221735\">この<ruby>紙<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>記入<rp>(</rp><rt>きにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのを<ruby>手伝<rp>(</rp><rt>てつだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请帮我填这张表格</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">絹</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きぬ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">丝绸；丝</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220131\">この<ruby>美<rp>(</rp><rt>うつく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいドレスは<ruby>絹<rp>(</rp><rt>きぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这件漂亮的裙子是丝绸做的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">記念</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きねん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">纪念</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">念</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昨日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きのう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">昨天；前一天</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機能</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きのう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">功能；机能；能力；特性</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196926\">ブレーキの<ruby>機能<rp>(</rp><rt>きのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めることだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">刹车的功能是使车停下。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/410844\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">甲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きのえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">十天干的第一位</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気の毒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きのどく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">可怜；不幸；悲惨；困苦；不可饶恕；遗憾；可惜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"86122\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>毒<rp>(</rp><rt>どく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>におもわずにはいられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能不为他感到难过</span></div></li>"]